rt them", "tr": "ve onları oyalasın", "fr": "et qu'elle les distraie", "id": "dan biarkan ia melalaikan mereka", "ur": "اور وہ انہیں غافل کر دے", "bn": "এবং তা যেন তাদের ভুলিয়ে রাখে", "fa": "و ایشان را سرگرم سازد"}}, {"text": "ٱلْأَمَلُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فَسَوْفَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يَعْلَمُونَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}], "forms": [{"arabic": "وَيُلْهِهِمُ", "count": 1, "first": "15:3", "audio": "audio/037ab021bef3577f2a5d.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": ["hum"], "mood": "jussive"}], "gloss": {"bs": "i neka ih zaokuplja", "en": "and let it divert them", "tr": "onları oyalasın", "fr": "et qu'il les détourne", "id": "dan biarlah dia mengalihkan mereka", "ur": "اور اسے ان کو بہکانے دو", "bn": "এবং তা তাদের মনোযোগ আকর্ষণ করুক", "fa": "و آنان را مشغول کند"}}, {"arabic": "تُلْهِيهِمْ", "count": 1, "first": "24:37", "audio": "audio/1bfc6edd832fbab51b27.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "hiya", "passive": false, "objects": ["hum"], "mood": "indicative"}]}, {"arabic": "تُلْهِكُمْ", "count": 1, "first": "63:9", "audio": "audio/e8aebed3d9d4c9093300.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "anta", "passive": false, "objects": ["antum"], "mood": "jussive"}]}, {"arabic": "أَلْهَىٰكُمُ", "count": 1, "first": "102:1", "audio": "audio/1b76e6a094cfe7c6ee20.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": ["antum"]}], "gloss": {"en": "it distracted you (all)", "bs": "zaokupilo vas je", "tr": "sizi oyaladı", "fr": "il vous a distraits", "id": "dia telah mengalihkan kalian", "ur": "اس نے تم سب کو غافل کیا", "bn": "তা তোমাদের মনোযোগ আকর্ষণ করেছে", "fa": "شما را مشغول کرد"}}], "ayatFile": "ayat/0578.json", "ayatTranslations": {"en": "ayat/0578.en.json", "tr": "ayat/0578.tr.json", "ur": "ayat/0578.ur.json", "id": "ayat/0578.id.json"}, "sentences": [{"arabic": "أَلْهَى اللَّعِبُ ا